# Copy to .env. Never commit real values. Everything here is optional; empty means the default.
# Service keys are made on first start.
#
# Nothing is needed here. Set in Legion admin instead:
# - Connections: the address and token of each gateway, the address of Treasury, and the model names that gateway
#   presets leave open (Azure deployments, vLLM models).
# - MCP servers: the tool servers the agents use.
#
# Starting value only: Compose sets this for the container. A Treasury address saved on the Connections page wins.
# Treasury, default http://127.0.0.1:29602
DB_GATEWAY_URL=
